<title>NETHERLANDS: Dutch Dec manufacturing sales rise four pct yr/yr.</title>
<headline>Dutch Dec manufacturing sales rise four pct yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>VOORBURG, Netherlands 1997-02-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dutch December manufacturing sales were some four percent higher than in the same month of 1995, the Central Bureau of Statistics said.</p>
<p>The CBS manufacturing sales figures refer to the guilder value of manufacturers' sales and are usually published one to two weeks before manufacturing production figures which show the rise or fall in volume terms.  </p>
<p>DUTCH MANUFACTURING SALES (pct change in guilders yr/yr)</p>
<p>				  Domestic	 Export	  Total</p>
<p> December			    6		3		4</p>
<p> November			    4		0		2</p>
<p> Q4 1996			     7		4		6</p>
<p> Q3 1996			     6		4		5</p>
<p> Q2 1996			     4		1		2</p>
<p> Q1 1996			     1	     -2		0</p>
<p> YR 1996			     5		2		3</p>
<p> YR 1995			     5		8		7</p>
<p> YR 1994			     3		6		5</p>
